# Testing

- Unit tests for pure logic (strategy, risk, metrics) with no network.
- Integration tests mock brokers/APIs (`PaperSimBroker`, httpx mocks).
- Mark network tests with `@pytest.mark.network` and keep them opt-in.
- E2E Playwright covers empty/error/loading, setup wizard, mobile width.
- After strategy/risk changes, run walk-forward on synthetic or sample data.
- Do not assert unrealistic Sharpe/accuracy in tests.
